[2025-04-14 21:29:33,140][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-55 << "                                    jxscout serves as a resource for security researchers looking to examine JavaScript code for vulnerabilities. It works seamlessly with proxies such as Burp or Caido to capture and arrange static assets, pre-fetch code segments, automatically beautify JS, and reverse source maps when the .map files are accessible.[\n]"
