[2025-04-14 22:05:00,485][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-0 << "                                    A threat actor, &apos;Jabaroot,&apos; claims to have breached Morocco&apos;s National Social Security Fund (CNSS), compromising the data of nearly 2 million citizens. The leak includes personal and financial details like passports, emails, and banking information, posing significant identity theft and fraud risks for those affected.[\n]"
