[2025-04-14 22:05:00,602][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-0 << "                                &lt;a href=&quot;https://tracking.tldrnewsletter.com/CL0/https:%2F%2Fwww.wiz.io%2Fblog%2Faws-vpc-endpoint-cloudtrail%3Futm_source=tldrinfosec/1/0100019624ffb35d-e9e60e4d-ae1b-4df6-8282-b1daf09a94df-000000/xUu-UPoHB5xzTqsZXHcS1tN7Mb4APnCxVQONRMvIrg0=400&quot;&gt;[\n]"
