[2025-04-14 22:05:00,701][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-0 << "                                    Managing VPN gateways, firewall rules, and security groups is time-consuming. Exposing API endpoints or using jump hosts creates security risks. Is there a better way? Watch the &lt;a href=&quot;https://tracking.tldrnewsletter.com/CL0/https:%2F%2Fnetbird.io%2Fwebinars%2Faccess-k8s-without-port-forwarding-and-jump-hosts%3Futm_medium=newsletter%26utm_source=tldr-infosec%26utm_campaign=20250410/2/010001961fdb0477-098cac9a-8e61-4a72-ad10-c88c589962ec-000000/jSjHmf47cELKSZpyQea9Rn9l0XDUSQY3TR2DIMJfK_M=400&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer nofollow&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;NetBird webinar recording&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and learn how to securely access Kubernetes from non-Kubernetes resources, with Zero Trust access to your control plane and services. &lt;a href=&quot;https://tracking.tldrnewsletter.com/CL0/https:%2F%2Fnetbird.io%2Fwebinars%2Faccess-k8s-without-port-forwarding-and-jump-hosts%3Futm_medium=newsletter%26utm_source=tldr-infosec%26utm_campaign=20250410/3/010001961fdb0477-098cac9a-8e61-4a72-ad10-c88c589962ec-000000/Z3mmdS0ijZwFnqfNaWJMJixoSQDuhA5ceBMKkJetUBA=400&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer nofollow&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Watch now&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;[\n]"
