[2025-04-14 22:05:00,854][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-0 << "                                    The Port of Seattle experienced a ransomware attack in August 2024 that disrupted its websites and phone systems, including Seattle-Tacoma International Airport. The breach affected the personal data of 90,000 individuals, prompting the Port to offer free credit monitoring and notify those impacted. The responsible group, Rhysida, has previously targeted multiple industries and organizations.[\n]"
