[2025-04-14 22:05:00,919][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-0 << "&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 22:05:00,919][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-0 << "                                    Microsoft&apos;s AI tool has detected critical vulnerabilities in bootloaders like GRUB2 and U-boot that enable attackers to bypass Secure Boot and deploy persistent malware. These flaws significantly threaten enterprises, allowing malware to survive OS reinstallation. Organizations must prioritize patching affected systems and improving firmware and bootloader updates.[\n]"
