[2025-04-14 22:05:01,001][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-0 << "&lt;p&gt;Material Security is purpose-built to protect the entire cloud workspace [0xe2][0x80][0x93] email, data, and accounts. With deep integration and powerful automations, Material prevents and detects a wider range of threats, responds to active attacks faster, and secures data and accounts even after a breach. All within a platform that fits seamlessly into existing workflows[0xe2][0x80][0x93]making your security team&apos;s jobs easier, and protecting your users without slowing them down.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
