[2025-04-14 22:05:01,049][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-0 << "                                    Lucid is a sophisticated Phishing-as-a-Service platform operated by Chinese threat actors. This blog dives into what it is, its targets, and the technology behind it. Lucid uses advanced SMS and iMessage technologies to enable large-scale phishing campaigns to steal credit card details. It has targeted more than 160+ organizations.[\n]"
