[2025-04-14 22:05:02,071][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;p&gt;CISA released ten Industrial Control Systems (ICS) advisories on April 10, 2025. These advisories provide timely information about current security issues, vulnerabilities, and exploits surrounding ICS.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
