[2025-04-14 22:05:02,255][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;/li&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 22:05:02,255][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;li&gt;ICSA-25-093-03 &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/ics-advisories/icsa-25-093-03&quot;&gt;ABB ACS880 Drives Containing CODESYS RTS&lt;/a&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 22:05:02,255][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;/li&gt;[\n]"
