[2025-04-14 22:05:02,255][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;/ul&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 22:05:02,255][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;p&gt;CISA encourages users and administrators to review newly released ICS advisories for technical details and mitigations.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
