[2025-04-14 22:05:02,459][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/USDHSCISA/2020/06/3486054/05152023-gov-delivery-banner-copy_original.png&quot; alt=&quot;Cybersecurity and Infrastructure Security Agency (CISA)&quot; title=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;600&quot; height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 22:05:02,459][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "  &lt;p&gt;You are subscribed to Cybersecurity Advisories for Cybersecurity and Infrastructure Security Agency. This information has recently been updated and is now available.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 22:05:02,459][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/alerts/2025/03/04/cisa-adds-four-known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 120%; font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;CISA Adds Four Known Exploited Vulnerabilities to Catalog&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 22:05:02,459][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;div class=&quot;rss_item&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom: 2em;&quot;&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 22:05:02,459][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;div class=&quot;rss_pub_date&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 90%; font-style: italic; color: #666666; margin: 0 0 0.3em; padding: 0;&quot;&gt;03/04/2025 12:00 PM EST&lt;/div&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 22:05:02,459][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;div class=&quot;rss_description&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0.3em; padding: 0;&quot;&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 22:05:02,459][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;p&gt;CISA has added four new vulnerabilities to its &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog&quot; title=&quot;Known Exploited Vulnerabilities Catalog&quot;&gt;Known Exploited Vulnerabilities Catalog&lt;/a&gt;, based on evidence of active exploitation.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 22:05:02,459][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;ul&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 22:05:02,459][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;li&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 22:05:02,459][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2024-50302&quot; title=&quot;Linux Kernel Use of Uninitialized Resource Vulnerability&quot;&gt;CVE-2024-50302&lt;/a&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]Linux Kernel Use of Uninitialized Resource Vulnerability&lt;/li&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 22:05:02,459][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;li&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 22:05:02,459][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2025-22225&quot; title=&quot;VMware ESXi Arbitrary Write Vulnerability&quot;&gt;CVE-2025-22225&lt;/a&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]VMware ESXi Arbitrary Write Vulnerability&lt;/li&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 22:05:02,459][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;li&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 22:05:02,459][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2025-22224&quot; title=&quot;VMware ESXi and Workstation TOCTOU Race Condition Vulnerability&quot;&gt;CVE-2025-22224&lt;/a&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]VMware ESXi and Workstation TOCTOU Race Condition Vulnerability&lt;/li&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 22:05:02,459][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;li&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 22:05:02,459][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2025-22226&quot; title=&quot;VMware ESXi, Workstation, and Fusion Information Disclosure Vulnerability&quot;&gt;CVE-2025-22226&lt;/a&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]VMware ESXi, Workstation, and Fusion Information Disclosure Vulnerability&lt;/li&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 22:05:02,459][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;/ul&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 22:05:02,459][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;p&gt;These types of vulnerabilities are frequent attack vectors for malicious cyber actors and pose significant risks to the federal enterprise.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 22:05:02,459][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/binding-operational-directive-22-01&quot; title=&quot;Binding Operational Directive (BOD) 22-01: Reducing the Significant Risk of Known Exploited Vulnerabilities&quot;&gt;Binding Operational Directive (BOD) 22-01: Reducing the Significant Risk of Known Exploited Vulnerabilities&lt;/a&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]established the Known Exploited Vulnerabilities Catalog as a living list of known Common Vulnerabilities and Exposures (CVEs) that carry significant risk to the federal enterprise. BOD 22-01 requires Federal Civilian Executive Branch (FCEB) agencies to remediate identified vulnerabilities by the due date to protect FCEB networks against active threats. See the&lt;a&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/sites/default/files/publications/Reducing_the_Significant_Risk_of_Known_Exploited_Vulnerabilities_211103.pdf&quot; title=&quot;BOD 22-01 Fact Sheet&quot;&gt;BOD 22-01 Fact Sheet&lt;/a&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]for more information.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 22:05:02,459][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;p&gt;Although BOD 22-01 only applies to FCEB agencies, CISA strongly urges all organizations to reduce their exposure to cyberattacks by prioritizing timely remediation of[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog&quot; title=&quot;Catalog vulnerabilities&quot;&gt;Catalog vulnerabilities&lt;/a&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]as part of their vulnerability management practice. CISA will continue to add vulnerabilities to the catalog that meet the[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities&quot; title=&quot;specified criteria&quot;&gt;specified criteria&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 22:05:02,459][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;This product is provided subject to this[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/notification&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Follow link&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Notification&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]and this[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/privacy-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Follow link&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Privacy &amp;amp; Use&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
