[2025-04-14 22:05:02,583][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;li&gt;ICSA-24-291-03 &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/ics-advisories/icsa-24-291-03&quot;&gt;Mitsubishi Electric CNC Series (Update A)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;/li&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 22:05:02,583][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;li&gt;ICSMA-25-051-01 &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/ics-medical-advisories/icsma-25-051-01&quot;&gt;Medixant RadiAnt DICOM Viewer&lt;/a&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 22:05:02,583][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;/li&gt;[\n]"
