[2025-04-14 22:05:02,638][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "  &lt;p&gt;You are subscribed to Cybersecurity Advisories for Cybersecurity and Infrastructure Security Agency. This information has recently been updated and is now available.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
