[2025-04-14 22:05:02,653][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Symantec Threat Hunter team, part of Broadcom, contributed to this guidance.[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
